COMMENT ON VIEW public.v_lapse_rate_current IS
'TODAY''S lapse rate only. Calls compute_lapse_rate with CURRENT_DATE, so it ignores any week you have in mind and its answer changes every day. Correct for "what is our lapse right now" displays and forward projections. NEVER use it for anything tied to a specific week - call compute_lapse_rate(agency_id, as_of_date) instead, which takes a date and returns week-accurate history back to at least 2026-06-27. compute_retention_floor_factor had this exact bug until 2026-08-29: a past week''s retention floor factor drifted every day.';
